## 2. Breakdowns API — `/api/breakdowns`

### 2.1 Create Breakdown  
**POST** `/api/breakdowns`

**Body:**
```json
{
  "unitId": "T680-554",
  "driverId": "DRV-882",
  "faultCodes": ["P0420", "P0700"],
  "location": { "lat": 40.68922, "lon": -75.22011 },
  "severity": "High"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "BRK-001",
  "status": "New",
  "unitId": "T680-554",
  "driverId": "DRV-882",
  "faultCodes": ["P0420", "P0700"],
  "location": { "lat": 40.68922, "lon": -75.22011 },
  "severity": "High",
  "repairPath": "Unknown"
}
```

---

### 2.2 Get Breakdown by ID  
**GET** `/api/breakdowns/:id`

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "BRK-001",
  "unitId": "T680-554",
  "driverId": "DRV-882",
  "technicianId": "TECH-442",
  "status": "In Progress",
  "faultCodes": ["P0420", "P0700"],
  "severity": "High",
